    <description>
        <p>pleNx is a third-party native Plex client designed for controller users to browse and play their movies and TV shows.</p>
        <p>Features:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Completely native interface, sign in with your Plex account (PIN link)</li>
            <li>Supported media items: movies, shows, seasons, episodes</li>
            <li>Based on the MPV player (direct play and transcoding)</li>
            <li>TV-style search, genres, collections and person pages</li>
        </ul>
    </description>
